{"id":4262,"title":{"romaji":"Touken Ranbu Kai: Kyoden Moyuru Honnouji","english":"TOUKEN RANBU KAI KYODEN","native":"刀剣乱舞 廻 -虚伝 燃ゆる本能寺-"},"slug":"touken_ranbu_kai_kyoden_moyuru_honnouji","synopsis":"One day, a new sword manifested at their citadel. \n\r\n\n\r\nFudou Yukimitsu: A sword worn by a commander of the Sengoku era, Oda Nobunaga, who was granted to one of his attending servants, Mori Ranmaru. Fudou Yukimitsu makes it known that he is proud to be Oda Nobunaga's beloved sword, but clashes with the other swords who also call Nobunaga their former master: Souza Samonji, Heshikiri Hasebe, and Yagen Toushirou. The appointed team captain, Yamanbagiri Kunihiro, must rally a citadel that has fallen into disarray at Fudou Yukimitsu's arrival. In the midst of all this, the saniwa has received an order to depart for the year 1582 -- the Honnouji event, where Oda Nobunaga met his demise... \n\r\n\n\r\nAnime production will be scripted and overseen by Kenichi Suemitsu, the director and playwright of the original play. \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: AniList)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2024,"createdAt":"2024-04-02 04:27:44","updatedAt":"2024-04-02 04:27:44","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":51859},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46142},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":150085},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18408},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":19833},{"site":"ANN","externalId":31517}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11688,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/Svjbib9v7RThKUlPdGXUAYzG3NxfUDmiem9dtcgz.png"},{"id":11689,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/BFfsY9kvF9nvH9RikDAAANwtfDN6b3fNn6uBa1rL.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":179,"name":"domerica","slug":"domerica"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":321,"name":"Touken Ranbu","slug":"touken_ranbu"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":12809,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12766,"title":{"romaji":"Whatever Happens","na